From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:32:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] ryGT: host-memory import prototype (P1/P2), ceiling
 switch EXP-125, DIAG-115

- P1 (SHADGT_PROTO_IMPORT=1): VK_EXT_external_memory_host import tests; imports work for
  writable guest views (GPU copy 12-15 GB/s, bytes match); a write-protected page in an
  imported range loses the device.
- P2 (SHADGT_PROTO_INPLACE=1, opt-in prototype): read/written ranges inside one imported
  view are used in place; imported views are never write-protected. 3 Tokyo races: 34.2 fps
  (no gain): the costly obtains span many scattered 2 MB views.
- EXP-125 SHADGT_CEIL_REGION, DIAG-115 arena read cycles by 16 MB block.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
