From 158e6709475ec67e19280d709f0ad1b24e1b1528 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:52:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] ryGT: D1 direct memory module (SHADGT_DIRECT=1): alias
 imports + GPU page table

Every guest view the renderer obtains a buffer from gets a writable alias (GuestArenaMapAlias)
imported into Vulkan with a device address; a two-level page table (16 KiB pages) maps guest
pages to it. Ryty unmaps release the views once the GPU passed them. Tokyo race: all ~500k
obtains per 2 s lie in imported memory (1,759 views, 3.3 GiB). N2/N3 tests: an alias import
stays readable by the GPU while the game's view is read-only or inaccessible; one import cannot
span two views.

