From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 03:42:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 07/14] D2-D4: direct memory renderer path behind
 SHADGT_DIRECT=1

Shaders read read-only guest buffers in place through a GPU page table over
imported guest memory (per-draw DirectTable, zero page, constant-buffer reads
included). BindBuffers skips the obtain for those buffers; graphics fences wait
for the GPU in direct mode; CE dump / WriteData targets stay on the copy path;
separate shader store (CUSA03220-direct). SHADGT_DIRECT_READS=0 bisects.

