EOS and WRITE_DATA labels held behind the GPU ride the next submit instead of
each making one (EOP still submits). Index buffers bind the imported guest
memory directly; vertex buffers can too (SHADGT_DIRECT_VB=1) but over PCIe the
GPU became the limit, so that stays off. Faster volatile-page check.

